&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7482&quot;&gt;Prior experience working with large and small language models in production or research settings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7583&quot;&gt;Background in reinforcement learning, prompt engineering, or transfer learning techniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7677&quot;&gt;Experience with developer tools, APIs, or frameworks related to AI model integration and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
