&lt;li&gt;Be a great listener!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;About You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A top performer with 5-7 years experience hunting and closing net new logos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with creatively sourcing pipeline outside of inbound lead flow&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to strategically map out and break into accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant sales experience in an Enterprise SaaS organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling developer and/or technical products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills both with customers and within an organization&lt;/li&gt;
