&lt;li&gt;Takes an active interest in increasing customer satisfaction and deepening customer relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The reasonably estimated compensation range for the role is $200,000 to $260,000 OTE, plus a competitive equity package. Actual compensation is based on the candidate&#39;s skills, qualifications, and experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
